Here is the function I included to standardize by 2 SDs and center the continuous variable (Gelman 2007):

# simple function to standardize variables
    std2=function(x){(x - mean(x,na.rm=TRUE))/(2*sd(x,na.rm=TRUE))}

Thanks,

Daniel

